# Temporary HP48gII stock I/O UI probe.
# A fresh full-NOR + empty SRAM starts at Try To Recover Memory?; choose NO
# to create the deterministic factory-default state.
2000 tap f6
7000 capture home
8000 tap files
9000 capture apps
9500 tap down
10000 tap enter
11000 capture io-functions
11500 tap down
12000 tap down
12500 tap down
13000 tap down
13500 tap down
14000 capture start-server-selected
14500 tap enter
16500 capture server
19000 finish-install
